# NICAI Constitutional Runtime — End-to-End Evidence

## 1. Document Purpose

This document provides the end-to-end runtime evidence for the NICAI Constitutional Runtime.

The purpose of this evidence package is to demonstrate that the NICAI runtime can maintain a traceable execution path from input through validation, intelligence processing, output generation, replay, and ecosystem integration boundaries.

The evidence model is based on the following principle:

```text
INPUT
  ↓
VALIDATION
  ↓
INTELLIGENCE
  ↓
PATTERN ANALYSIS
  ↓
OUTPUT
  ↓
TRACE
  ↓
LOGGING
  ↓
REPLAY
  ↓
ECOSYSTEM BOUNDARY
```

NICAI remains a deterministic decision-support system.

It does not execute external decisions.

