# 3. Constitutional Runtime Principle

NICAI produces intelligence and evidence.

NICAI does not claim ownership of external ecosystem systems unless an explicit contract establishes that ownership.

Therefore:

```text
NICAI
  |
  +-- validates inputs
  |
  +-- generates intelligence
  |
  +-- generates traceable outputs
  |
  +-- records runtime evidence
  |
  +-- supports replay
  |
  +-- prepares bounded integration payloads
  |
  +-- preserves ownership boundaries
  |
  X-- does not execute external authority decisions
```

